---
/**
 * Coaching page: “Our Coaching Methodology” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-c9b9e7f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="c9b9e7f"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-918a8c3 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
      data-id="918a8c3"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="heading.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Our Coaching Methodology</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-bac3ffe vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="bac3ffe"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><p>Structured, Practical, Measurable</p></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-7f48660 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="7f48660"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <p>
          At VentureBean, we integrate the Six Sigma framework in our coaching framework to deliver a coaching
          experience that is strategic, highly structured, and results-driven. This integrated methodology ensures that
          every coaching engagement is tailored to individual and team development needs, linked to organisational
          objectives and goals, anchored in data, tracked for measurable, time-bound impact. Our approach sharpens
          performance and enhances accountability, alignment, and long-term success across functions and leadership
          levels.&nbsp;
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
